tely throws himself into the investigation.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11371,\"title\":\"The Score\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fsb4m9XW59mei8GKznvI3lLzcfp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tCBcuOw60wjzLvg9oJdZKlBn1nG.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An aging thief hopes to retire and live off his ill-gotten wealth when a young kid convinces him into doing one last heist.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9573,\"title\":\"Blood Work\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A6wWJkIREagRWFNu3YotID3n9aW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6Jatq6wjJ4c2YbPkE5e5VzukEI2.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Still recovering from a heart transplant, a retired FBI profiler returns to service when his own blood analysis offers clues to the identity of a serial killer.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Crime\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":385332,\"title\":\"Terminal\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xi7pA3lL6Wb78p6Y6PgWoHDMjrM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8K5S5W0te4FJ0GVRHcPYPETWwLA.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the dark heart of a sprawling, anonymous city, two assassins carry out a sinister mission, a teacher battles a fatal illness, and an enigmatic janitor and a curious waitress lead dangerous double lives.  Murderous consequences unravel in the dead of night, as their lives intertwine at the hands of a mysterious criminal mastermind who is hell-bent on revenge.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4597,\"title\":\"Armored\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oQrAXGkBy84FyGpWrY71ptqs7zD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/EOAv4NeWOxB5rfGmDJTofX3j3Z.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A crew of officers at an armored transport security firm risk their lives when they embark on the ultimate heist against their own company. Armed with a seemingly fool-proof plan, the men plan on making off with a fortune with harm to none. But when an unexpected witness interferes, the plan quickly unravels and all bets are off.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2017,\"title\":\"No Good Deed\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lrQU72BcSfzJx71X1ko2K4LTtlE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/29t7THr2KxAHcCrtd1yxaaNW3g9.jpg\",\"rating\":5.4,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"While doing a friend a favor and searching for a runaway teenager, a police detective stumbles upon a bizarre band of criminals about to pull off a bank robbery.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1075519,\"title\":\"The Locksmith\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kNQ9Z3TQ5vU5fvwuHqZvLooFcCI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/PFJ2wNS3m5A85CFNPszc3bbDsc.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A thief fresh out of prison, tries to work his way back into the life of his daughter and ex-fiancé. Determined, he is forced to use the skills he has as a gifted locksmith. Things take a tumultuous turn after an unexpected disappearance.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11169,\"title\":\"Spartan\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rcdhS2g1d38NOoeh0PPAN2bLE7w.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1dm0kjWhYDcVPyBk0CZRThxwNyK.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"U.S. government agent Scott is assigned to rescue the daughter of a high-ranking government official. As willing as he is to bend the rules to get things done, though, Scott is shocked to find that others are willing to go even further to protect a political career.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":228968,\"title\":\"Kidnapping Mr. Heineken\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6JAb9jQa4sONkutfqfR3I7LFpGd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ngSezgLoXhJmG5786Yq6lelxaTj.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The true story of the kidnapping of Freddy Heineken, the grandson of the founder of the Heineken brewery, and his driver. They were released after a ransom of 35 million Dutch guilders was paid.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Action\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":61537,\"title\":\"Burn Notice: The Fall of Sam Axe\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wgQuP4qrsjw4kNgR3sYQeaCNllm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lpYER5hPpg1NHki8EVmcDeWi1vs.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Before Sam Axe teamed up with Michael and Fiona, he was Commander Axe, U.S. Navy SEAL. The Fall of Sam Axe tells the story of how Sam went from respected Naval Commander to the man of mystery we've come to know on Burn Notice. On what will turn out to be Sam's last military mission, he is sent to the jungles of Colombia to investigate claims of a vicious terrorist organization known only as the \\\"Espada Ardiente\\\" (Flaming Sword). His mission: to determine whether U.S. military aid is necessary to deal with the threat. But when he arrives, things are more complicated than he'd imagined. He receives word that the rebels have targeted a small civilian clinic deep in the jungle. Sam must now save the clinic's doctors and patients from certain death. However, nothing is as it seems and the Espada Ardiente may not be the biggest threat Sam Axe faces.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13197,\"title\":\"10th & Wolf\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wzrJMJKZIpp5iw1S0zRx8xkxh5F.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vrzwTtQwloQ4Ywnh3tV0zf6Thaq.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A former street thug returns to his Philadelphia home after a stint in the military. Back on his home turf, he once again finds himself tangling with the mob boss who was instrumental in his going off to be a soldier.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":663870,\"title\":\"Riders of Justice\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sshNnwmQLk720iBQ0dZg3GVGKfK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7XZsVVnqTsMJXg3J4CHzeV2Lro9.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Markus returns home to care for his daughter when his wife dies in a tragic train accident. However, when a survivor of the wreck surfaces and claims foul play, Markus suspects his wife was murdered and embarks on a mission to find those responsible.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"Y-rJeEB8wWw\",\"name\":\"Freelancers 2012 - Official Trailer [HD]\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}